2025-03-14 00:15:32 | INFO | backend:_conversation:442 - 收到前端请求数据: {'query': '如何判断数据变化率是否大于阈值', 'result': "To determine if the data change rate is greater than a threshold, you can use the following SQL query against your database's history table (e.g., `dba_hist_snapshot` and `dba_hist_undo_segstats`). This example uses a threshold of 10% for demonstration purposes; adjust as needed.\n\nFirst, let's assume we have two metrics: total undo generated (`total_undo_gen`) and total undo consumed (`total_undo_consumed`). We'll calculate the daily change rate for each metric and compare it to the threshold.\n\n```sql\n-- Set variables with your desired threshold (e.g., 10% or 0.1)\nDECLARE\n  threshold_pct NUMBER := 0.1;\nBEGIN\n  -- Calculate data change rate for total undo generated\n  SELECT\n    CASE\n      WHEN LAG(total_undo_gen) OVER (ORDER BY begin_interval_time) IS NULL THEN 0\n      ELSE ((total_undo_gen - LAG(total_undo_gen) OVER (ORDER BY begin_interval_time)) / LAG(total_undo_gen) OVER (ORDER BY begin_interval_time)) * 100\n    END AS undo_gen_change_pct,\n    CASE\n      WHEN total_undo_gen > threshold_pct THEN 'Above threshold'\n      ELSE 'Below threshold'\n    END AS undo_gen_threshold_status\n  FROM\n    dba_hist_snapshot\n  WHERE\n    instance_number = <your_instance_number>\n    AND begin_interval_time >= TRUNC(SYSDATE) - INTERVAL '1' DAY;\n\n  -- Calculate data change rate for total undo consumed (similar to above)\n  SELECT\n    CASE\n      WHEN LAG(total_undo_consumed) OVER (ORDER BY begin_interval_time) IS NULL THEN 0\n      ELSE ((total_undo_consumed - LAG(total_undo_consumed) OVER (ORDER BY begin_interval_time)) / LAG(total_undo_consumed) OVER (ORDER BY begin_interval_time)) * 100\n    END AS undo_consume_change_pct,\n    CASE\n      WHEN total_undo_consumed > threshold_pct THEN 'Above threshold'\n      ELSE 'Below threshold'\n    END AS undo_consume_threshold_status\n  FROM\n    dba_hist_snapshot\n  WHERE\n    instance_number = <your_instance_number>\n    AND begin_interval_time >= TRUNC(SYSDATE) - INTERVAL '1' DAY;\nEND;\n/\n```\n\nIn this query, replace `<your_instance_number>` with your actual instance number. The query will return the daily change rate for both total undo generated and consumed, along with a status indicating whether each metric is above or below the specified threshold.\n\nYou can adjust the threshold percentage (`threshold_pct`) and time frame (`TRUNC(SYSDATE) - INTERVAL '1' DAY`) as needed to fit your specific use case. Additionally, you can modify the metrics used in this example to suit your requirements.", 'source_documents': [Document(metadata={'source': '/root/mentor_agent/oradoc/statistics.md'}, page_content='如何诊断表统计信息是否过期流程\n\n获取 PLAN 包含表的统计信息情况\n\n这是整个流程的起点，表示从 PLAN 中获取表的统计信息。\n\n判断统计信息是否过期或被 restore\n\n如果统计信息未过期（否），则直接进入“统计信息正常”状态。\n\n如果统计信息过期或被 restore，则需要进一步检查。\n\n判断是否为大表或大分区过期\n\n如果是大表或大分区过期（是），则需要进一步检查。\n\n如果不是大表或大分区过期（否），则继续进行常规的统计信息检查。\n\n判断数据变化率是否大于阈值\n\n如果数据变化率大于阈值（是），则需要处理统计信息过期，变化率大的情况。\n\n如果数据变化率不大于阈值（否），则统计信息过期但变化率不大，直接进入“Pass End”。\n\n检查特定日志文件\n\n对于大表或大分区统计信息过期且变化率大的情况，需要检查 check_result.log。\n\n对于统计信息过期但变化率不大的情况，需要检查 check_result.log。\n\n检查参数日志\n\n针对统计信息过期的表，需要检查 check_param.log。\n\n收集统计信息\n\n在检查日志后，需要执行“Gather Stats”操作，以更新统计信息。\n\n结束流程\n\n经过以上步骤后，如果一切正常，则流程结束，标记为“Pass End”。'), Document(metadata={'source': '/root/mentor_agent/oradoc/故障应急预案_ORA-4031_v1.0.docx'}, page_content='ORA-4031应急预案-ORA-4031应急处理步骤\n检查SGA中各组件的状况  \n一般应急状况下，处理的第一时间不用去检查共享池碎片，意义不大。而且4031错误同样有可能导致整个数据库实例hang，所以应该去检查什么组件大小比较异常（有条件的话同类似的其他库环境去对比）。  \nselect t.* From (Select Name, round(bytes / (1024 * 1024),2) "MB",round(bytes / (Select sum(bytes) From v$sgainfo t  \nWhere t.name = \'Shared Pool Size\') * 100,2) || \'%\' "USED%" From v$sgastat Where pool = \'shared pool\' Order By 2 Desc) t Where rownum < 20;  \n可以回收空间的组件占比大  \n根据当前组件大小状态，判断是哪部分出了问题，如果是可以回收空间的组件，条件允许的话通过flush shared_pool来处理。比如sql area、Child cursor等占据主要大小，可能与硬解析有关，可以通过下面的查询确认：  \ncolumn FORCE_MATCHING_SIGNATURE format 99999999999999999999999  \nwith c as  \n(select force_matching_signature, count(*) cnt  \nfrom v$sqlarea  \nwhere force_matching_signature != 0  \ngroup by force_matching_signature  \nhaving count(*) > 20),  \nsq as  \n(select sql_text,  \nforce_matching_signature,  \nrow_number() over(partition by force_matching_signature order by sql_id desc) p  \nfrom v$sqlarea s  \nwhere force_matching_signature in  \n(select force_matching_signature from c))  \nselect sq.sql_text, sq.force_matching_signature, c.cnt "unshared count"  \nfrom c, sq  \nwhere sq.force_matching_signature = c.force_matching_signature  \nand sq.p = 1  \norder by c.cnt desc;  \nNote:  \nflush shared_pool 可能引起“解析风暴”导致CPU使用率激增，需要充分评估后执行。  \n无法回收的组件占比大  \n如果是无法回收的perm组件，则必须重启实例。  \n如果情况特别紧急，可以考虑临时缩小Buffer cache，调大shared pool，等到维护窗口后再重启实例恢复。  \n--确认现在SGA使用状况  \nSelect nvl(pool,name) "pool", Sum(bytes) / (1024 * 1024) "MB"  \nFrom v$sgastat  \nGroup By nvl(pool,name)  \norder by Sum(bytes) / (1024 * 1024) desc;  \npool MB  \n-------------------------- ----------  \nbuffer_cache 1104  \nshared pool 336  \nlarge pool 32  \njava pool 16  \nlog_buffer 7.125  \nfixed_sga 2.14918518  \n6 rows selected.  \nSQL> SHOW PARAMETER shared_pool_size  \nNAME TYPE VALUE  \n------------------------------------ ----------- ------------------------------  \nshared_pool_size big integer 0  \nSQL> SHOW PARAMETER db_cache_size  \nNAME TYPE VALUE  \n------------------------------------ ----------- ------------------------------  \ndb_cache_size big integer 0  \n--确认Granule Size  \nselect bytes/(1024 * 1024) " Granule Size (MB)" from v$sgainfo where name like \'Granule Size\';  \nGranule Size (MB)  \n------------------  \n16  \n--缩小db_cache_size – 80M  \nalter system set db_cache_size = 1024M scope=memory;  \n--增大shared_pool_size + 80M  \nalter system set shared_pool_size = 416M scope=memory;  \nSystem altered.  \nSQL> SHOW PARAMETER shared_pool_size  \nNAME TYPE VALUE  \n------------------------------------ ----------- ------------------------------  \nshared_pool_size big integer 416M  \nSQL> SHOW PARAMETER db_cache_size  \nNAME TYPE VALUE  \n------------------------------------ ----------- ------------------------------  \ndb_cache_size big integer 1G  \nSQL> Select nvl(pool,name) "pool", Sum(bytes) / (1024 * 1024) "MB"  \nFrom v$sgastat  \nGroup By nvl(pool,name)  \norder by Sum(bytes) / (1024 * 1024) desc;  \npool MB  \n-------------------------- ----------  \nbuffer_cache 1024  \nshared pool 416  \nlarge pool 32  \njava pool 16  \nlog_buffer 7.125  \nfixed_sga 2.14918518  \n6 rows selected.  \nNote:  \n1. 上述命令会把 Buffer Cache 中的部分数据块 purge 出 SGA，从而引起物理I/O增多，需要充分评估后执行。\n2. 上述调整的大小必须是最小单位是“Granule unit”大小的整数倍。\n3. 上述命令可能因为其他关联参数（sga_target/ sga_max_size、memory_target/ memory_max_target等）设置和SGA的使用状况失败。'), Document(metadata={'source': '/root/mentor_agent/oradoc/故障应急预案_ORA-4031_v1.0.docx'}, page_content='ORA-4031 信息采集和后续分析\n在重启或者刷新shared_pool前，收集相关信息留做进一步的根因诊断。  \n* ORA-4031 诊断数据1  \nconn / as sysdba  \n@srdc_db_ora4031.sql  \n* ORA-4031 诊断数据2  \n例子：  \ntfactl diagcollect –srdc ORA-04031  \ntfactl diagcollect –srdc ORA-04031 -database db -from "Mar/13/2015" -to "Mar/13/2015 15:00:00"  \n* ash dump 数据  \nconn / as sysdba  \n@ash_dump.sql  \n* awr Report 数据  \nconn / as sysdba  \n@awr_report.sql  \n* dba_hist_sgastat 数据  \nconn / as sysdba  \nset lines 300 pages 9999  \ncol name format a40  \ncol begin_interval_time format a30  \nPrompt \'Large memory allocation component\'  \nselect a.instance_number,b.begin_interval_time,a.name,a.pool,a.bytes  \nfrom dba_hist_sgastat a, dba_hist_snapshot b  \nwhere a.snap_id=b.snap_id  \nand a.instance_number = b.instance_number  \nand a.dbid = b.dbid  \nand a.bytes >= 200*1024*1024  \nand begin_interval_time>= sysdate - 14  \norder by a.instance_number,b.begin_interval_time,a.bytes;  \n* OSW 数据  \ncd oswbb/archive  \nfind . -name "*22.03.18.2[1-3]*" -exec zip /tmp/osw_`hostname`_220317_21-23.zip {} \\;  \n* TFA 数据  \nsu - root  \ntfactl diagcollect -from "Jun/12/2022 18:00:00" -to "Jun/21/2022 23:59:59"  \n* OPATCH 数据  \nopatch lsinventory -detail'), Document(metadata={'source': '/root/mentor_agent/oradoc/故障应急预案_ORA-4031_v1.0.docx'}, page_content='ORA-4031应急预案\nORA-4031是Oracle数据库进程（前台进程或后台进程都有可能）向数据库实例的Shared Pool（或其他）申请一块共有内存时，数据库实例无法从持有的SGA中找到符合要求的内存时发生的错误。  \n数据库进程在发生ORA-4031时会中断。如果这个进程是前台进程，应用程序会接收到ORA-4031报错，应用程序需要进行回滚或其他方式的应用恢复。如果这个进程是后台进程，则有可能引起数据库实例重启等。')]}
