2025-03-14 01:34:57 | INFO | backend:_conversation:439 - 收到前端请求数据: {'query': '判断数据变化率是否大于阈值', 'result': "To determine if the data variation rate is greater than a threshold, you can calculate the percentage change between two points in time and compare it to your desired threshold. Here's how you can do this using SQL for the `dba_hist_sgastat` table:\n\nFirst, let's assume we have two timestamps: `t1` (the earlier point) and `t2` (the later point). We'll calculate the percentage change in bytes allocated to each pool between these two points.\n\n```sql\nWITH thresholds AS (\n  SELECT\n    'buffer_cache' AS pool,\n    0.5 AS threshold -- Set your desired threshold here\n  UNION ALL\n  SELECT 'shared_pool', 0.3\n  UNION ALL\n  SELECT 'large_pool', 0.2\n  UNION ALL\n  SELECT 'java_pool', 0.15\n  UNION ALL\n  SELECT 'log_buffer', 0.1\n  UNION ALL\n  SELECT 'fixed_sga', 0.05\n),\ndata AS (\n  SELECT\n    name AS pool,\n    bytes,\n    begin_interval_time,\n    instance_number,\n    dbid\n  FROM dba_hist_sgastat\n  WHERE begin_interval_time BETWEEN TRUNC(t1) AND TRUNC(t2)\n),\nvariation AS (\n  SELECT\n    pool,\n    SUM(bytes) OVER (PARTITION BY pool, instance_number, dbid ORDER BY begin_interval_time) AS running_total_bytes,\n    COUNT(*) OVER (PARTITION BY pool, instance_number, dbid ORDER BY begin_interval_time) AS running_count\n  FROM data\n)\nSELECT\n  variation.pool,\n  CASE\n    WHEN running_count > 1 THEN ROUND((running_total_bytes / LAG(running_total_bytes) OVER (PARTITION BY variation.pool, instance_number, dbid ORDER BY begin_interval_time) - 1) * 100, 2)\n    ELSE 0\n  END AS variation_rate,\n  thresholds.threshold\nFROM variation\nJOIN thresholds ON variation.pool = thresholds.pool;\n```\n\nThis query will return the percentage change in bytes allocated to each pool between `t1` and `t2`, along with the threshold for that pool. If the variation rate is greater than the threshold, you'll need to take appropriate actions based on your ORA-4031 application emergency plan.\n\nDon't forget to replace `t1` and `t2` with your desired timestamps. Also, adjust the thresholds according to your specific requirements.\n\nTo determine if the data variation rate is consistently above the threshold over time, you can create a moving average or use other statistical methods to analyze the trend in bytes allocated to each pool.", 'source_documents': [Document(metadata={'source': '/root/mentor_agent/oradoc/statistics.md'}, page_content='如何诊断表统计信息是否过期流程\n\n获取 PLAN 包含表的统计信息情况\n\n这是整个流程的起点，表示从 PLAN 中获取表的统计信息。\n\n判断统计信息是否过期或被 restore\n\n如果统计信息未过期（否），则直接进入“统计信息正常”状态。\n\n如果统计信息过期或被 restore，则需要进一步检查。\n\n判断是否为大表或大分区过期\n\n如果是大表或大分区过期（是），则需要进一步检查。\n\n如果不是大表或大分区过期（否），则继续进行常规的统计信息检查。\n\n判断数据变化率是否大于阈值\n\n如果数据变化率大于阈值（是），则需要处理统计信息过期，变化率大的情况。\n\n如果数据变化率不大于阈值（否），则统计信息过期但变化率不大，直接进入“Pass End”。\n\n检查特定日志文件\n\n对于大表或大分区统计信息过期且变化率大的情况，需要检查 check_result.log。\n\n对于统计信息过期但变化率不大的情况，需要检查 check_result.log。\n\n检查参数日志\n\n针对统计信息过期的表，需要检查 check_param.log。\n\n收集统计信息\n\n在检查日志后，需要执行“Gather Stats”操作，以更新统计信息。\n\n结束流程\n\n经过以上步骤后，如果一切正常，则流程结束，标记为“Pass End”。'), Document(metadata={'source': '/root/mentor_agent/oradoc/故障应急预案_ORA-4031_v1.0.docx'}, page_content='ORA-4031应急预案-ORA-4031应急处理步骤\n检查SGA中各组件的状况  \n一般应急状况下，处理的第一时间不用去检查共享池碎片，意义不大。而且4031错误同样有可能导致整个数据库实例hang，所以应该去检查什么组件大小比较异常（有条件的话同类似的其他库环境去对比）。  \nselect t.* From (Select Name, round(bytes / (1024 * 1024),2) "MB",round(bytes / (Select sum(bytes) From v$sgainfo t  \nWhere t.name = \'Shared Pool Size\') * 100,2) || \'%\' "USED%" From v$sgastat Where pool = \'shared pool\' Order By 2 Desc) t Where rownum < 20;  \n可以回收空间的组件占比大  \n根据当前组件大小状态，判断是哪部分出了问题，如果是可以回收空间的组件，条件允许的话通过flush shared_pool来处理。比如sql area、Child cursor等占据主要大小，可能与硬解析有关，可以通过下面的查询确认：  \ncolumn FORCE_MATCHING_SIGNATURE format 99999999999999999999999  \nwith c as  \n(select force_matching_signature, count(*) cnt  \nfrom v$sqlarea  \nwhere force_matching_signature != 0  \ngroup by force_matching_signature  \nhaving count(*) > 20),  \nsq as  \n(select sql_text,  \nforce_