**How can we systematically troubleshoot and resolve this 'Down' status issue with the Oracle Exadata Storage Server (cnxxxxx), given that both HBA Controller Status and Ping Status are unknown/failed? What are the recommended steps to identify the root cause and restore availability, considering that the current causal analysis result is inconclusive?**
2025-03-14 21:27:40 | INFO | backend:_conversation:291 - 收到前端请求数据: {'query': "Based on the provided text, here's a deep question:\n\n**How can we systematically troubleshoot and resolve this 'Down' status issue with the Oracle Exadata Storage Server (cnxxxxx), given that both HBA Controller Status and Ping Status are unknown/failed? What are the recommended steps to identify the root cause and restore availability, considering that the current causal analysis result is inconclusive?**", 'result': "To systematically troubleshoot and resolve the 'Down' status issue with the Oracle Exadata Storage Server (cnxxxxx), follow these steps:\n\n1. **Gather Detailed Information:**\n   - Check the `crsctl` command output for detailed information about the storage server's status.\n     ```\n     crsctl stat res -v\n     ```\n   - Review the clusterware log files (`/u01/crs/log/cluster/crsd.log`) for any relevant error messages.\n\n2. **Check HBA Controller Status:**\n   - Since the HBA Controller Status is unknown/failed, use the following commands to gather more information:\n     ```\n     /usr/sbin/mststatus\n     /usr/sbin/mstconfig -v\n     ```\n   - Check if there are any HBA-related errors or warnings in the output.\n\n3. **Ping Status:**\n   - As Ping Status is also unknown/failed, perform a ping test from the storage server to other nodes in the cluster and vice versa.\n     ```\n     ping <node_name_or_ip>\n     ```\n   - Check if there are any network connectivity issues.\n\n4. **Check Storage Server Processes:**\n   - Verify that all required processes (e.g., `crsd`, `evm`, `oraagent`) are running on the storage server.\n     ```\n     ps -ef | grep crs\n     ```\n\n5. **Review Clusterware and Grid Infrastructure Logs:**\n   - Check `/u01/crs/log/cluster/` and `/u01/grid/log/` directories for any relevant error messages or warnings related to the 'Down' status.\n\n6. **Check Storage Server Hardware:**\n   - Verify that there are no hardware-related issues (e.g., disk failures, memory errors) by running the following commands:\n     ```\n     /usr/sbin/hwinvcheck\n     /usr/sbin/hwprobe\n     ```\n\n7. **Review Alert Logs:**\n   - Check the alert logs (`/u01/app/grid/cfgtoollogs/alert_<date>.log`) for any relevant error messages or warnings.\n\n8. **Restart Services (if applicable):**\n   - If you find that a specific service is not running or has failed, try restarting it using the following command:\n     ```\n     crsctl stop crs -f\n     crsctl start crs\n     ```\n\n9. **Contact Oracle Support:**\n   - If you're unable to identify and resolve the issue after performing these steps, consider opening a service request with Oracle Support for further assistance.\n\nBy following these steps, you should be able to gather enough information to identify the root cause of the 'Down' status issue and restore availability for the Oracle Exadata Storage Server (cnxxxxx).", 'source_documents': [Document(metadata={'source': '/root/mentor_agent/oradoc/HBA.md'}, page_content="HBA Card 或 HBA Controller 性能故障\n\n流程步骤\n\nASR 警告：系统检测到 ASR 警告。\n\n判断条件：符合判断条件采取应急措施。\n\n更换硬件：如果需要，进行硬件更换。\n\n故障节点\n\nOffline Cell 故障节点：检查是否存在 Offline Cell 故障。参考如下步骤 Steps to shut down or reboot an Exadata storage cell without affecting ASM (Doc ID 1188080.1)\n\n检查和调大每个Diskgroup 的disk_repair_time 设置，默认值是3.6小时，如果cell node offline 超过这个值，该cell上所有ASM disk会被强制删除。 SQL> select dg.name,a.value from v$asm_diskgroup dg, v$asm_attribute a where dg.group_number=a.group_number and a.name='disk_repair_time'; SQL> ALTER DISKGROUP DATA SET ATTRIBUTE 'DISK_REPAIR_TIME'='8.5H';<<-------根据需要调大disk_repair_time 的设置。\n\n12c 之后的高版本，ASM DG 引入一个新属性 failgroup_repair_time，默认值是24H，该参数控制Diskgroup 的failure group 维护时间，如果DG 中的failgroup Offline 超过了该值，将被强制drop。 SQL> select dg.name,a.value from v$asm_diskgroup dg, v$asm_attribute a where dg.group_number=a.group_number and a.name=' failgroup_repair_time '; SQL> alter diskgroup\n\n如果grid disk offline 后，grid disk输出应该是asmdeactivationoutcome=’YES’ 否则是NO, asmmodestatus 应该是 ONLINE\n\ncellcli <<<<<<<< cell 节点执行cellcli 进入到 CeLLCLI> 命令行\n\nCellCLI> list griddisk attributes name,asmmodestatus,asmdeactivationoutcome\n\nCell node poweroff 前，需要把grid disk offline，下面是offline grid disk 命令： CellCLI> CellCLI -e alter griddisk all inactive\n\n检查grid disk 状态是offline, asmmodestatus 应该是 UNUSED or OFFLINE ，asmdeactivationoutcome 应该是YES，如果不是Yes，等待和重复检查，直到asmdeactivationoutcome=’YES’ ，并且用 list griddisk 确保状态都是inactive CellCLI> list griddisk attributes name,asmmodestatus,asmdeactivationoutcome CellCLI> list griddisk\n\n关闭 cell node OS\n\nshutdown -h now\n\n重启 cell node,一旦操作系统完成启动后，手工拉起grid disks，并所有grid disk 状态是 active CellCLI> alter griddisk all active CellCLI> list griddisk\n\n检查所有grid disk的状态是ONLINE CellCLI> list griddisk attributes name, asmmodestatus\n\n故障信息收集： 收集 Sundiag output。 登陆到目标 cell节点\n\n/opt/oracle.SupportTools/sundiag.sh <<<<<< 单服务器收集命令\n\ndcli -g all_group -l root /opt/oracle.SupportTools/sundiag.sh 2>&1 (备注：dcli 命令实现单次完成所有节点的sundiag 日志收集，需要配置节点间root 信任关系，如果不允许配置节点间的信任关系，利用上面的命令逐台机器收集。另外，这种方式仅是集中采集,生成的sundiag output 存放在各自服务器上。)\n\nHBSC 一体机故障应急预案\n\n如果存在 Offline Cell 故障，则进行 HangDown 判断。\n\nHangDown 处理流程\n\n容灾切换 Switchover：尝试进行容灾切换。\n\nSwitchover 失败：如果切换失败，进入下一步。\n\n容灾切换 Failover：进行容灾切换。\n\n结束：完成处理流程。"), Document(metadata={'source': '/root/mentor_agent/oradoc/故障应急预案_ORA-4031_v1.0.docx'}, page_content='ORA-4031应急预案-ORA-4031应急处理步骤\n检查SGA中各组件的状况  \n一般应急状况下，处理的第一时间不用去检查共享池碎片，意义不大。而且4031错误同样有可能导致整个数据库实例hang，所以应该去检查什么组件大小比较异常（有条件的话同类似的其他库环境去对比）。  \nselect t.* From (Select Name, round(bytes / (1024 * 1024),2) "MB",round(bytes / (Select sum(bytes) From v$sgainfo t  \nWhere t.name = \'Shared Pool Size\') * 100,2) || \'%\' "USED%" From v$sgastat Where pool = \'shared pool\' Order By 2 Desc) t Where rownum < 20;  \n可以回收空间的组件占比大  \n根据当前组件大小状态，判断是哪部分出了问题，如果是可以回收空间的组件，条件允许的话通过flush shared_pool来处理。比如sql area、Child cursor等占据主要大小，可能与硬解析有关，可以通过下面的查询确认：  \ncolumn FORCE_MATCHING_SIGNATURE format 99999999999999999999999  \nwith c as  \n(select force_matching_signature, count(*) cnt  \nfrom v$sqlarea  \nwhere force_matching_signature != 0  \ngroup by force_matching_signature  \nhaving count(*) > 20),  \nsq as  \n(select sql_text,  \nforce_matching_signature,  \nrow_number() over(partition by force_matching_signature order by sql_id desc) p  \nfrom v$sqlarea s  \nwhere force_matching_signature in  \n(select force_matching_signature from c))  \nselect sq.sql_text, sq.force_matching_signature, c.cnt "unshared count"  \nfrom c, sq  \nwhere sq.force_matching_signature = c.force_matching_signature  \nand sq.p = 1  \norder by c.cnt desc;  \nNote:  \nflush shared_pool 可能引起“解析风暴”导致CPU使用率激增，需要充分评估后执行。  \n无法回收的组件占比大  \n如果是无法回收的perm组件，则必须重启实例。  \n如果情况特别紧急，可以考虑临时缩小Buffer cache，调大shared pool，等到维护窗口后再重启实例恢复。  \n--确认现在SGA使用状况  \nSelect nvl(pool,name) "pool", Sum(bytes) / (1024 * 1024) "MB"  \nFrom v$sgastat  \nGroup By nvl(pool,name)  \norder by Sum(bytes) / (1024 * 1024) desc;  \npool MB  \n-------------------------- ----------  \nbuffer_cache 1104  \nshared pool 336  \nlarge pool 32  \njava pool 16  \nlog_buffer 7.125  \nfixed_sga 2.14918518  \n6 rows selected.  \nSQL> SHOW PARAMETER shared_pool_size  \nNAME TYPE VALUE  \n------------------------------------ ----------- ------------------------------  \nshared_pool_size big integer 0  \nSQL> SHOW PARAMETER db_cache_size  \nNAME TYPE VALUE  \n------------------------------------ ----------- ------------------------------  \ndb_cache_size big integer 0  \n--确认Granule Size  \nselect bytes/(1024 * 1024) " Granule Size (MB)" from v$sgainfo where name like \'Granule Size\';  \nGranule Size (MB)  \n------------------  \n16  \n--缩小db_cache_size – 80M  \nalter system set db_cache_size = 1024M scope=memory;  \n--增大shared_pool_size + 80M  \nalter system set shared_pool_size = 416M scope=memory;  \nSystem altered.  \nSQL> SHOW PARAMETER shared_pool_size  \nNAME TYPE VALUE  \n------------------------------------ ----------- ------------------------------  \nshared_pool_size big integer 416M  \nSQL> SHOW PARAMETER db_cache_size  \nNAME TYPE VALUE  \n------------------------------------ ----------- ------------------------------  \ndb_cache_size big integer 1G  \nSQL> Select nvl(pool,name) "pool", Sum(bytes) / (1024 * 1024) "MB"  \nFrom v$sgastat  \nGroup By nvl(pool,name)  \norder by Sum(bytes) / (1024 * 1024) desc;  \npool MB  \n-------------------------- ----------  \nbuffer_cache 1024  \nshared pool 416  \nlarge pool 32  \njava pool 16  \nlog_buffer 7.125  \nfixed_sga 2.14918518  \n6 rows selected.  \nNote:  \n1. 上述命令会把 Buffer Cache 中的部分数据块 purge 出 SGA，从而引起物理I/O增多，需要充分评估后执行。\n2. 上述调整的大小必须是最小单位是“Granule unit”大小的整数倍。\n3. 上述命令可能因为其他关联参数（sga_target/ sga_max_size、memory_target/ memory_max_target等）设置和SGA的使用状况失败。'), Document(metadata={'source': '/root/mentor_agent/oradoc/故障应急预案_ORA-4031_v1.0.docx'}, page_content='ORA-4031 信息采集和后续分析\n在重启或者刷新shared_pool前，收集相关信息留做进一步的根因诊断。  \n* ORA-4031 诊断数据1  \nconn / as sysdba  \n@srdc_db_ora4031.sql  \n* ORA-4031 诊断数据2  \n例子：  \ntfactl diagcollect –srdc ORA-04031  \ntfactl diagcollect –srdc ORA-04031 -database db -from "Mar/13/2015" -to "Mar/13/2015 15:00:00"  \n* ash dump 数据  \nconn / as sysdba  \n@ash_dump.sql  \n* awr Report 数据  \nconn / as sysdba  \n@awr_report.sql  \n* dba_hist_sgastat 数据  \nconn / as sysdba  \nset lines 300 pages 9999  \ncol name format a40  \ncol begin_interval_time format a30  \nPrompt \'Large memory allocation component\'  \nselect a.instance_number,b.begin_interval_time,a.name,a.pool,a.bytes  \nfrom dba_hist_sgastat a, dba_hist_snapshot b  \nwhere a.snap_id=b.snap_id  \nand a.instance_number = b.instance_number  \nand a.dbid = b.dbid  \nand a.bytes >= 200*1024*1024  \nand begin_interval_time>= sysdate - 14  \norder by a.instance_number,b.begin_interval_time,a.bytes;  \n* OSW 数据  \ncd oswbb/archive  \nfind . -name "*22.03.18.2[1-3]*" -exec zip /tmp/osw_`hostname`_220317_21-23.zip {} \\;  \n* TFA 数据  \nsu - root  \ntfactl diagcollect -from "Jun/12/2022 18:00:00" -to "Jun/21/2022 23:59:59"  \n* OPATCH 数据  \nopatch lsinventory -detail'), Document(metadata={'source': '/root/mentor_agent/oradoc/statistics.md'}, page_content='如何诊断表统计信息是否过期流程\n\n获取 PLAN 包含表的统计信息情况\n\n这是整个流程的起点，表示从 PLAN 中获取表的统计信息。\n\n判断统计信息是否过期或被 restore\n\n如果统计信息未过期（否），则直接进入“统计信息正常”状态。\n\n如果统计信息过期或被 restore，则需要进一步检查。\n\n判断是否为大表或大分区过期\n\n如果是大表或大分区过期（是），则需要进一步检查。\n\n如果不是大表或大分区过期（否），则继续进行常规的统计信息检查。\n\n判断数据变化率是否大于阈值\n\n如果数据变化率大于阈值（是），则需要处理统计信息过期，变化率大的情况。\n\n如果数据变化率不大于阈值（否），则统计信息过期但变化率不大，直接进入“Pass End”。\n\n检查特定日志文件\n\n对于大表或大分区统计信息过期且变化率大的情况，需要检查 check_result.log。\n\n对于统计信息过期但变化率不大的情况，需要检查 check_result.log。\n\n检查参数日志\n\n针对统计信息过期的表，需要检查 check_param.log。\n\n收集统计信息\n\n在检查日志后，需要执行“Gather Stats”操作，以更新统计信息。\n\n结束流程\n\n经过以上步骤后，如果一切正常，则流程结束，标记为“Pass End”。')]}
