2025-03-20 11:11:24 | INFO | ora_tools:check_rag:44 - 收到前端请求数据: [{'document': '/root/mentor_agent/oradoc/运维手册_20220819 .docx', 'content': '日常运维-工具介绍-SYSTEMSTATE DUMP-简介\nsystemstate dump，我们习惯叫它ssd，当数据库出现严重的性能问题或者hang了的时候，我们非常需要通过systemstate dump来知道进程在做什么，在等待什么，谁是资源的持有者，谁阻塞了别人。在出现上述问题时，及时收集systemstate dump非常有助于问题原因的分析。在一些情况下，数据库会自动生成systemstate dump, 比如出现了“WAITED TOO LONG FOR A ROW CACHE ENQUEUE LOCK”。', 'score': 0.4038063883781433}]
2025-03-20 11:19:04 | INFO | ora_tools:check_rag:44 - 收到前端请求数据: [{'document': '/root/mentor_agent/oradoc/运维手册_20220819 .docx', 'content': "日常运维-工具介绍-ERROR STACK-使用方式-实例级别：\n-- 开启命令  \n以对ora 984错误设定error stack为例：  \nSQL> alter system set event='984 trace name errorstack forever,level 3' scope=spfile;  \n-- 关闭命令  \nSQL> alter system set event='984 trace name errorstack off' scope=spfile;  \n【注意】  \n1. 如果event还有其他事件，则需要一起设置。大多数时候error stack在会话级别设置的情况居多。", 'score': 0.4468348026275635}]
2025-03-20 11:24:33 | INFO | ora_tools:check_rag:44 - 收到前端请求数据: [{'document': '/root/mentor_agent/oradoc/运维手册_20220819 .docx', 'content': '日常运维-工具介绍-AWRDUMP-使用方式-写filename\nEnter value for file_name: awrdata_30_40  \n即可输出dmp文件  \n【实际案例】  \n例如，以19c中pdb模式下，收集pdb中的awrdump为例，收集步骤同nocdb模式。  \n14:58:14 SYS@pdb19c> show pdbs  \n2 PDB$SEED READ ONLY NO  \n3 PDB01 READ WRITE NO  \n15:07:36 SYS@pdb19c> alter session set container=PDB01;  \nElapsed: 00:00:00.17  \n15:07:49 SYS@pdb19c> set timing off  \n15:08:04 SYS@pdb19c> start $ORACLE_HOME/rdbms/admin/awrextr.sql  \n~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\nAWR EXTRACT\n\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~  \n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\n~ This script will extract the AWR data for a range of snapshots ~\n\n~ into a dump file. The script will prompt users for the ~\n\n~ following information: ~\n\n~ (1) database id ~\n\n~ (2) snapshot range to extract ~\n\n~ (3) name of directory object ~\n\n~ (4) name of dump file ~\n\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~  \nDatabases in this Workload Repository schema  \n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\nDB Id DB Name Host\n\n------------ ------------ ------------\n\n4144881536 PDB19C kvm00010.jjq\n\ning.com\n\nThe default database id is the local one: \'4144881536\'. To use this\n\ndatabase id, press <return> to continue, otherwise enter an alternative.\n\nEnter value for dbid:\n\nUsing 4144881536 for Database ID\n\nSpecify the number of days of snapshots to choose from\n\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~  \nEntering the number of days (n) will result in the most recent  \n(n) days of snapshots being listed. Pressing <return> without  \nspecifying a number lists all completed snapshots.  \nEnter value for num_days: 2  \nListing the last 2 days of Completed Snapshots  \nDB Name Snap Id Snap Started  \n------------ --------- ------------------  \nPDB19C 1 19 Nov 2021 14:13  \n2 19 Nov 2021 14:18  \n3 19 Nov 2021 14:36  \n4 19 Nov 2021 14:38  \nSpecify the Begin and End Snapshot Ids  \n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\nEnter value for begin_snap: 1\n\nBegin Snapshot Id specified: 1\n\nEnter value for end_snap: 4\n\nEnd Snapshot Id specified: 4\n\nSpecify the Directory Name\n\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~  \nDirectory Name Directory Path  \n------------------------------ -------------------------------------------------  \nBLOBDIR /tmp  \nDATA_PUMP_DIR /u01/app/oracle/admin/pdb19c/dpdump/C076A38EBC927  \n68DE053AA03A8C0710B  \nJAVA$JOX$CUJS$DIRECTORY$ /u01/app/oracle/product/19.3.0/db_1/javavm/admin/  \nOPATCH_INST_DIR /u01/app/oracle/product/19.3.0/db_1/OPatch  \nOPATCH_LOG_DIR /u01/app/oracle/product/19.3.0/db_1/rdbms/log  \nOPATCH_SCRIPT_DIR /u01/app/oracle/product/19.3.0/db_1/QOpatch  \nORACLE_BASE /u01/app/oracle  \nORACLE_HOME /u01/app/oracle/product/19.3.0/db_1  \nORACLE_OCM_CONFIG_DIR /u01/app/oracle/product/19.3.0/db_1/ccr/state  \nORACLE_OCM_CONFIG_DIR2 /u01/app/oracle/product/19.3.0/db_1/ccr/state  \nSDO_DIR_ADMIN /u01/app/oracle/product/19.3.0/db_1/md/admin  \nSDO_DIR_WORK /u01/app/oracle/product/19.3.0/db_1/work  \nXMLDIR /u01/app/oracle/product/19.3.0/db_1/rdbms/xml  \nXSDDIR /u01/app/oracle/product/19.3.0/db_1/rdbms/xml/schema  \nChoose a Directory Name from the above list (case-sensitive).  \nEnter value for directory_name: OPATCH_LOG_DIR  \nUsing the dump directory: OPATCH_LOG_DIR  \nSpecify the Name of the Extract Dump File  \n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\nThe prefix for the default dump file name is awrdat_1_4.\n\nTo use this name, press <return> to continue, otherwise enter\n\nan alternative.\n\nEnter value for file_name:\n\nUsing the dump file prefix: awrdat_1_4\n\n|\n\n| ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\n| The AWR extract dump file will be located\n\n| in the following directory/file:\n\n| /u01/app/oracle/product/19.3.0/db_1/rdbms/log\n\n| awrdat_1_4.dmp\n\n| ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\n| *** AWR Extract Started ...\n\n| This operation will take a few moments. The\n\n| progress of the AWR extract operation can be\n\n| monitored in the following directory/file:\n\n| /u01/app/oracle/product/19.3.0/db_1/rdbms/log\n\n| awrdat_1_4.log\n\nEnd of AWR Extract\n\n## ASH\n\n### 简介\n\n对于数据库整理慢的时候，我们可以通过AWR来定位，非整体问题，比如特定的业务感知慢，AWR很难体现出细节，或者即使体现出也只是统计方面的证据，而非细节的直接证据，比如log file sync是不是由于IO太慢导致 --> 通常看log file parallel write，AWR是一段时间的平均值，瞬时超时类型的问题，log file parallel write可能被平均化，即使11g有等待事件的直方图信息也只能推测IO有过高延迟分布，但无法和具体的瞬时超时对应上。这种情况下，我们就需要ASH分析细节信息。\n\n对于ASH，大家都不陌生，在诊断性能问题上，非常的有帮助，可以查看在问题时间段的等待事件，以及其等待时间和涉及的sql，sql的执行时间等。\n\n对于ash的使用，如果是adg的主库，或者非adg的普通库，我们可以使用dba_hist_active_sess_history和gv$active_session_history/v$active_session_history。\n\n如果是adg备库，只能使用gv$active_session_history/v$active_session_history，因为备库的dba数据字典是主库的信息，并非备库。\n\n### 使用方法\n\nASH的使用，可以执行ashrpt.sql脚本来收集text或者html的ash报告，也可以直接查询ash相关的试图。\n\ngv$active_session_history会每秒钟将数据库所有节点的Active Session采样一次\n\ndba_hist_active_sess_history则会将gv$active_session_history里的数据每10秒采样一次并持久化保存。\n\n基于这个特征，我们可以通过分析dba_hist_active_sess_history的Session采样情况，来定位问题发生的准确时间范围，并且可以观察每个采样点的top event和top holder。\n\n搜集ASH 信息数据\n\nSQL> @?/rdbms/admin/ashrpt.sql\n\n当如果需要收集的实例已经宕机，可以通过下面方法在另一个活着的实例收集宕机实例的AWR和ASH报告：\n\nSQL> SELECT output FROM TABLE( DBMS_WORKLOAD_REPOSITORY.ASH_REPORT_HTML( <dbid>, <inst_id>, to_date(\'<starttime>\',\'yyyy-mm-dd hh24:mi:ss\'), to_date(\'<endtime>\',\'yyyy-mm-dd hh24:mi:ss\') )) ;\n\n【注意】\n\n参数需要客户化\n\n1. <dbid>需要替换为要提取的数据库dbid，可以从v$database获取当前数据库的dbid\n2. <inst_id>需要替换为要生成AWR报告的实例号\n3. <starttime>需要替换为开始时间\n4. <endtime>需要替换为结束时间\n\n## AWR\n\n### 简介\n\n对于AWR报告，需要收集有性能问题的节点的报告，如果是RAC，还是要远程节点的AWR 报告\n\n对于性能问题比较频繁的问题，间隔的时间可以为半小时和1小时。\n\n对于时间发生较短的问题，还可以手工进行性能采集.\n\n### 使用方法\n\n一般情况下，需要采集性能好和性能差时间段比较的报告。\n\n相关脚本使用方法如下:\n\n手工采集的脚本为:\n\nEXECUTE DBMS_WORKLOAD_REPOSITORY.CREATE_SNAPSHOT();\n\nAWR 信息的脚本为:\n\nSQL> @$ORACLE_HOME/rdbms/admin/awrinfo.sql\n\nAWR 信息的配置信息为：\n\nSQL> @$ORACLE_HOME/rdbms/admin/awrrpt.sql\n\n当如果需要收集的实例已经宕机，可以通过下面方法在另一个活着的实例收集宕机实例的AWR报告：\n\nSQL> SELECT output FROM TABLE(DBMS_WORKLOAD_REPOSITORY.AWR_REPORT_HTML( <dbid>, <inst_id>, <startsnapid>, <endsnapid>) ) ;\n\n【注意】\n\n参数需要客户化\n\n1. <dbid>需要替换为要提取的数据库dbid，可以从v$database获取当前数据库的dbid\n2. <inst_id>需要替换为要生成AWR报告的实例号\n3. <startsnapid>需要替换为开始快照号\n4. <endsnapid>需要替换为结束快照号\n\n## AHF（TFA）\n\n### 简介\n\nOracle公司为了解决用户反馈在故障诊断的过程中，需要使用各种命令，收集各种各样的繁琐的日志，费时费力，于是Oracle在11.2的版本之后，推出了Trace File Analyzer Collector（TFA）。\n\n在April 2020以后升级为 AHF (Oracle Autonomous Health Framework )，包括了TFA与Orachk/Exachk，它可以用非常简单的命令协助用户收集RAC里的日志，以便进一步进行诊断；\n\nTFA是类似diagcollection的一个oracle 集群日志收集器，而且TFA比diagcollection集中和自动化的诊断信息收集能力更强大。\n\n### 安装部署（更新方案）\n\n#### RAC更新方案\n\n##### 下载最新版本AHF\n\nMOS搜索文档：《Autonomous Health Framework (AHF) - Including TFA and ORAchk/EXAchk (Doc ID 2550798.1)》\n\n选择 Download 下载最新版AHF的对应操作系统版本\n\n##### 上传并解压AHF安装包（节点1运行）\n\n[root@xtts19c01 ~]# cd /tmp\n\n[root@xtts19c01 tmp]# ls -lrt AHF*\n\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 411836201 Jan 6 15:31 AHF-LINUX_v21.4.0.zip\n\n[root@xtts19c01 tmp]# unzip AHF-LINUX_v21.4.0.zip -d ./AHF\n\nArchive: AHF-LINUX_v21.4.0.zip\n\ninflating: ./AHF/README.txt\n\ninflating: ./AHF/ahf_setup\n\nextracting: ./AHF/ahf_setup.dat\n\ninflating: ./AHF/oracle-tfa.pub\n\n##### 手动停止tfa（节点1运行）\n\n[root@xtts19c01 tmp]# ps -ef |grep tfa\n\nroot 1959 1 0 Jan05 ? 00:00:03 /bin/sh /etc/init.d/init.tfa run >/dev/null 2>&1 </dev/null\n\nroot 3354 1 0 Jan05 ? 00:04:35 /u01/app/19.3.0/grid/jdk/jre/bin/java -server -Xms64m -Xmx128m -Djava.awt.headless=true -Ddisable.checkForUpdate=true oracle.rat.tfa.TFAMain /u01/app/19.3.0/grid/tfa/xtts19c01/tfa_home\n\ngrid 19236 1 0 Jan05 ? 00:03:34 /bin/sh ./OSWatcher.sh 15 240 NONE /u01/app/grid/tfa/repository/suptools/xtts19c01/oswbb/grid/archive\n\ngrid 19645 19236 0 Jan05 ? 00:00:03 /bin/sh ./OSWatcherFM.sh 240 /u01/app/grid/tfa/repository/suptools/xtts19c01/oswbb/grid/archive\n\nroot 72329 56094 0 16:23 pts/3 00:00:00 grep --color=auto tfa\n\n[root@xtts19c01 tmp]# /bin/sh /etc/init.d/init.tfa stop\n\nStopping TFA from init for shutdown/reboot\n\nWARNING - TFA Software is older than 180 days. Please consider upgrading TFA to the latest version.\n\nTFA-00002 Oracle Trace File Analyzer (TFA) is not running\n\nStopped OSWatcher\n\nNothing to do !\n\nTFA-00104 Cannot establish connection with TFA Server. Please check TFA Certificates\n\n. . .\n\nSuccessfully stopped TFA..\n\n[root@xtts19c01 tmp]# ps -ef |grep tfa\n\nroot 74750 56094 0 16:26 pts/3 00:00:00 grep --color=auto tfa\n\n##### AHF安装（节点1运行）\n\n[root@xtts19c01 tmp]# cd AHF\n\n[root@xtts19c01 AHF]# ./ahf_setup\n\nAHF Installer for Platform Linux Architecture x86_64\n\nAHF Installation Log : /tmp/ahf_install_214000_75640_2022_01_06-16_35_00.log\n\nStarting Autonomous Health Framework (AHF) Installation\n\nAHF Version: 21.4.0 Build Date: 202112200745\n\nTFA is already installed at : /u01/app/19.3.0/grid/tfa/xtts19c01/tfa_home\n\nInstalled TFA Version : 183300 Build ID : 20190315044534\n\nDefault AHF Location : /opt/oracle.ahf\n\nDo you want to install AHF at [/opt/oracle.ahf] ? [Y]|N : Y <<<<<< 输入 Y\n\nAHF Location : /opt/oracle.ahf\n\nAHF Data Directory stores diagnostic collections and metadata.\n\nAHF Data Directory requires at least 5GB (Recommended 10GB) of free space.\n\nChoose Data Directory from below options :\n\n1. /u01/app/grid [Free Space : 13705 MB]\n\n2. Enter a different Location\n\nChoose Option [1 - 2] : 1 <<<<<< 输入 1\n\nAHF Data Directory : /u01/app/grid/oracle.ahf/data\n\nShutting down TFA : /u01/app/19.3.0/grid/tfa/xtts19c01/tfa_home\n\nCopying TFA Data Files from /u01/app/19.3.0/grid/tfa/xtts19c01/tfa_home\n\nUninstalling TFA : /u01/app/19.3.0/grid/tfa/xtts19c01/tfa_home\n\nDo you want to add AHF Notification Email IDs ? [Y]|N : N <<<<<< 输入 N\n\nAHF will also be installed/upgraded on these Cluster Nodes :\n\n1. xtts19c02\n\nThe AHF Location and AHF Data Directory must exist on the above nodes\n\nAHF Location : /opt/oracle.ahf\n\nAHF Data Directory : /u01/app/grid/oracle.ahf/data\n\nDo you wan